WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Try it on a calculator.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.230
Type 2 + 3 × 4.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.300
A scientific calculator shows 14.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.600
Now put brackets round 2 + 3.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.930
It shows 20.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.016
Brackets change the answer.
